<Project>
  <!-- Deliberately does NOT import the repo-root Directory.Build.props.
       MSBuild walks up and stops at the FIRST Directory.Build.props it finds, so
       this file shields the operator host from the root's SbprValidateSdkPaths
       target, which hard-errors unless the Valheim managed-assembly path is set.

       Like tests/ and qa-operator-harness/, this host link-compiles ONLY the
       SHIPPED engine-free IAP-009 / T022 core source files (Application/Accounts/*,
       Features/PilotIdentity/LocalAllowlistBootstrap.cs, LiveStoreProvisioningGuard.cs,
       and their engine-free deps — all free of UnityEngine/HarmonyLib/Valheim refs)
       and references no game/BepInEx assemblies, so it must not inherit the
       Valheim-SDK requirement. It runs headless on the server host. The shipping mod
       project at src/ lives in a sibling subtree and still finds the root props
       unchanged, so this override does not affect it. -->
</Project>
